-- ============ TAB BUTTONS (old 9-slice text bars, user ruling 2026-10-08) ============
-- Every tab and sub-tab uses these three bars; every other button stays square icon art
-- (ButtonAssets / MakeButton / MakeIconButton above are unchanged).
